  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands MFA RDPP Horn of Africa, 2016-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at achieving three purposes;

1) To ensure that refugees are protected and have improved access to basic rights and services. 
2) To improve education, livelihood and employment opportunities and integrated and durable basic services delivery for the host populations and refugees. 
3) To strengthen capacity of local and central authorities to develop and implement an integrated approach towards refugees, host communities and mixed migration.</narrative>
  </description>
